1
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:20,853
Beyond the veil of night, on the other side

2
00:00:22,906 --> 00:00:28,493
To those of you ten thousand miles away

3
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:33,200
Have you been well ?　As usual ?

4
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,030
A light flashes on old photographs

5
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,746
The scent of the city, the smile on your face

6
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:44,630
The early days are still vivid

7
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:48,360
Please remember

8
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:52,150
You and I, we've been running together

9
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:55,730
Watch over me

10
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:58,330
I'll sing here

11
00:00:58,328 --> 00:01:00,420
for this <b>Decade</b> to come

12
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:06,138
As long as your voice reaches me

13
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:07,990
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

14
00:01:07,988 --> 00:01:13,520
I'll be singing in my corner of this planet

15
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:15,577
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

16
00:01:15,580 --> 00:01:21,246
It may be trivial　and only for yourself

17
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:23,140
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

18
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:28,820
But this is your one and only love song

19
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,637
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

20
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:44,330
Long before dots connected together

21
00:01:46,261 --> 00:01:51,824
When you were still nobody

22
00:01:52,597 --> 00:01:56,426
Fighting alone in painful times

23
00:01:56,440 --> 00:02:00,186
You held up the lamp through the dark night roads

24
00:02:00,190 --> 00:02:04,037
Your feelings, your melody

25
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:07,789
I won't forget, not matter how long it's been

26
00:02:07,790 --> 00:02:11,536
Please remember

27
00:02:11,541 --> 00:02:15,317
You and I, we've been running together

28
00:02:15,330 --> 00:02:18,880
Watch over me

29
00:02:18,875 --> 00:02:21,480
I'll sing here

30
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,630
for this <b>Decade</b> to come

31
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:29,330
We don't know when to give up

32
00:02:29,330 --> 00:02:31,160
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

33
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:36,590
We'll be singing in our corner of this planet

34
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:38,750
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

35
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:44,450
Appearing and disappearing, floating in ordinary days

36
00:02:44,450 --> 00:02:46,303
<i>for this <b>Decade</b> to come</i>

37
00:02:46,303 --> 00:02:51,957
In this moment it shines bright, your one and only love song

38
